{{> header title="Reset your password" subtitle="Enter the code below to continue" }}

<p>Hello <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your password. Use this code to set a new one:</p>

<div class="code"
    style="font-size:32px; font-weight:700; text-align:center; letter-spacing:8px; color:#2C1810; background:#FAF8F5; border:1px solid #EDE7E0; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 10px; margin:22px 0;">
    {{resetCode}}</div>

<p class="muted" style="color:#8A7C6E; font-size:14px;">This code expires in
    <strong>{{expiryTime}}</strong> and can only be used once. It locks after
    several incorrect attempts.</p>

<div class="security-note"
    style="background:#FBF7F0; border-left:3px solid #C9A227; padding:16px 18px; margin:22px 0; border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px;">Did not ask for this? You can ignore this
        email &mdash; your password will not change, and nobody can reset it without
        the code above.</p>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 28px;">Thank you,<br>The {{companyName}} Team</p>
